SMRの配信に使っていただきたいとプレゼントを考えています\n※彼女が配信で使うことをお許しください\n※左（向かって右）の胸元にほくろあります\n衣装はお任せしますので、よろしくご検討ください\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@Kokoro_Ch", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@misaki_yu1522/works/390", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 604119, "client_id": 3548469, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/81308835/uploads/origins/cb98b725-7c2d-4ce9-8463-757be8484fc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ab3d3024c2ad64063010fc6c68bf2e6", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/81308835/uploads/origins/cb98b725-7c2d-4ce9-8463-757be8484fc9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9f32e3a8975f514cb4692302d653f76f", "src_set": ""}, "body": "はじめまして、あなたのアート・スタイルがとても気に入っています。\n\n私のFF14のミコテを描いてほしいです。ポーズや背景は自由です。武器は描かなくていいです。\n\n小さく穏やかな笑顔をお願いします。\n\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1t5s5Qnab_KmQpt18cds8RKtMib3MX0Dh?usp=drive_link", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 751221, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "つゆぞら", "screen_name": "tuyu_zora", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1530392406683942912/6X3PP8Ia.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1265058393028349952/1677403327/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 0}, {"id": 786180, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "wawa", "screen_name": "wawatiku", "avatar_url": "h